## Resync mode

<!-- awf:section resync-note -->
When this agent is invoked in **resync mode** (the prompt contains `RESYNC mode`), run only the `scope-completeness` and `doc-currency` lenses. The remaining lenses already ran during the initial plan review and need not re-run unless explicitly requested.

Resync mode is triggered by the `{{ .prefix }}-reviewing-plan-resync` skill after whichever review settled - an ADR review converging, or a plan review that found at least one linked ADR. Its purpose is to catch plan-vs-finalised-ADR drift.
<!-- awf:end -->

